{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>由Yak &amp; Co開發的冒險解謎遊戲Down in Bermuda現正在Epic Games平台限時免費，香港時間9月3日23:00截止。玩家將扮演飛行員Milton，在充滿神秘色彩的百慕大群島展開一場結合解謎與逃脫的奇幻旅程。</p>\n<p>遊戲中，Milton因一場異常風暴被困在百慕大的時間泡泡內長達數十年。玩家需要破解密碼、解開謎題、收集魔法球，逐一逃離六座風格迥異的島嶼，並尋找回家的方法。本作由曾推出特務解謎遊戲Agent A: A puzzle in disguise的工作室製作，延續了精緻的關卡設計與輕鬆詼諧的敘事風格，適合喜愛解謎冒險的玩家。</p>\n\n<img alt=\"【Android】百慕大解謎逃脫 Down in Bermuda限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Egs-Downinbermuda-Yakco-G1a-11-1920x1080-435721791.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"【Android】百慕大解謎逃脫 Down in Bermuda限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Egs-Downinbermuda-Yakco-G1a-03-1920x1080-435720995.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"【Android】百慕大解謎逃脫 Down in Bermuda限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Egs-Downinbermuda-Yakco-G1a-05-1920x1080-435721606.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"【Android】百慕大解謎逃脫 Down in Bermuda限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Egs-Downinbermuda-Yakco-G1a-06-1920x1080-435721486.jpg\"/>\n<p>遊戲名稱：Down in Bermuda<br/>支援平台：Android<br/>領取位置：Epic Games</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T00:40:07.512155+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}